        {
            "name": "WebSocket Connections",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "📋 One-to-One Chat WebSocket Connection Guide",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/websocket-info/chat",
                            "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
                            "path": ["websocket-info", "chat"]
                        },
                        "description": "📌 **WebSocket Connection Instructions for One-to-One Chat**\n\n**🔗 Connection URL:** `ws://103.190.136.200:3000/chat`\n\n**📝 How to Connect in Postman:**\n1. Create a **NEW WebSocket Request** (not HTTP GET)\n2. Set URL to: `ws://103.190.136.200:3000/chat`\n3. Click **Connect**\n4. Send messages in JSON format below\n\n**🔐 Authentication (Send First):**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"authenticate\", \n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"{{jwt_token}}\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**🏠 Join Conversation:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"joinConversation\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"conversationId\": \"{{conversation_id}}\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**💬 Send Message:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"sendMessage\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"conversationId\": \"{{conversation_id}}\",\n    \"content\": \"Hello from Postman WebSocket!\",\n    \"messageType\": \"text\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**📜 Get Message History:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"getMessageHistory\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"conversationId\": \"{{conversation_id}}\",\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"limit\": 20\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**⌨️ Typing Indicator:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"typing\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"conversationId\": \"{{conversation_id}}\",\n    \"isTyping\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**✅ Mark as Read:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"markAsRead\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"conversationId\": \"{{conversation_id}}\",\n    \"messageIds\": [\"message-id-1\", \"message-id-2\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**⚠️ Note:** This is a guide request. For actual WebSocket testing, create a new WebSocket request in Postman with the URL above."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "📋 Group Chat WebSocket Connection Guide",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/websocket-info/group-chat",
                            "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
                            "path": ["websocket-info", "group-chat"]
                        },
                        "description": "📌 **WebSocket Connection Instructions for Group Chat**\n\n**🔗 Connection URL:** `ws://103.190.136.200:3000/group-chat`\n\n**📝 How to Connect in Postman:**\n1. Create a **NEW WebSocket Request** (not HTTP GET)\n2. Set URL to: `ws://103.190.136.200:3000/group-chat`\n3. Click **Connect**\n4. Send messages in JSON format below\n\n**🔐 Authentication (Send First):**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"authenticate\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"{{jwt_token}}\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**👥 Join Group:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"joinGroup\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"groupUuid\": \"{{group_uuid}}\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**💬 Send Message:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"sendMessage\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"groupUuid\": \"{{group_uuid}}\",\n    \"content\": \"Hello group from Postman WebSocket!\",\n    \"messageType\": \"text\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**✏️ Edit Message:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"editMessage\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"groupUuid\": \"{{group_uuid}}\",\n    \"messageId\": \"{{message_id}}\",\n    \"content\": \"Edited message content\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**🗑️ Delete Message:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"deleteMessage\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"groupUuid\": \"{{group_uuid}}\",\n    \"messageId\": \"{{message_id}}\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**📜 Get Message History:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"getMessageHistory\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"groupUuid\": \"{{group_uuid}}\",\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"limit\": 20\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**⌨️ Typing Indicator:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"typing\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"groupUuid\": \"{{group_uuid}}\",\n    \"isTyping\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**✅ Mark as Read:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"markAsRead\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"groupUuid\": \"{{group_uuid}}\",\n    \"messageIds\": [\"message-id-1\", \"message-id-2\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**🚪 Leave Group:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"leaveGroup\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"groupUuid\": \"{{group_uuid}}\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**⚠️ Note:** This is a guide request. For actual WebSocket testing, create a new WebSocket request in Postman with the URL above."
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
